From 0aac8e8cfe33da75e24d15d5d8ee740f796f6153 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Oskari=20Yl=C3=B6nen?= <oskari.ylonen@iki.fi>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 23:06:18 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] cycle: add DirectionalCycleWindows action

Allow spatial window selection using north, south, east and west bindings.
Rank content centers by distance along the requested axis, perpendicular
distance and activation order. Include minimized windows and keep the
selection unchanged when no candidate exists.

Show a themed outline without raising windows during selection. Disable
key repeat, cancel on Escape or selected-window destruction, and commit
when all modifiers are released. Run the initiating binding's finalactions,
defaulting to Focus, Raise and Unshade. Cancel before configuration reload
so the borrowed action list cannot outlive its configuration.

Add geometry tests and a headless Wayland integration client covering
navigation, modifier release, cancellation, finalactions and Alt-Tab.
Both test paths pass with address and undefined behavior sanitizers.
